{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"17830","name":"Nizza","description":"Perfectly located few steps from the main railway station Roma Termini - terminal for the main lines of public transport - and at the same time conveniently detached from the noise of the main streets, Hotel Nizza is the right place for those clients who look both for a very central location and a relaxing atmosphere. All its 70 rooms have private bathroom, hair dryer, direct telephone line, air conditioning and satellite TV. The Hotel offers a bar, a TV room with internet point, parking on request. There is also a private area for the service of temporary parking for tourist buses. Business clients have also the possibility to book full equipped meeting rooms up to 40 people. From Hotel Nizza you can easily walk to the main attractions of the city: Coliseum, Trevi Fountain, Spanish steps and the Roman Forum. The hotel offers a 24h reception, fax service and luggage deposit. Buffet breakfast from 7 to 10 am. ***There is city tax payable by guest directly to hotel","address":"Via Massimo D'Azeglio, 16","city":"ROME","countryCode":"IT","postalCode":"00184","lat":41.899856,"lng":12.497382,"stars":3,"giataCode":"52541","phone":"+39064881061","email":"INFO@HOTELNIZZAROMA.COM","website":"http://www.hotelnizzaroma.com/","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017830/017830a_hb_a_001.jpg","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017830/017830a_hb_a_002.jpg","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017830/017830a_hb_a_003_20250820_104559.jpg","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017830/017830a_hb_a_004_20250820_104605.jpg","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017830/017830a_hb_l_001.jpg","category":"lobby","order":4},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/01/017830/017830a_hb_l_